jsoncheck (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added HTTP server using libmicrohttpd.
  * Added JSON validation and formatting HTTP API.
  * Added Docker image with health checks.
  * Added automated Docker Hub deployment with smoke tests.

