jsoncheck (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added unit and CLI tests using CTest.
  * Added AddressSanitizer and UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer checks.
  * Added code coverage verification using gcovr.
  * Added GitHub Actions CI pipeline.
  * Added automated GitHub Release creation.

 -- Diss2D <126177961+Diss2D@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:05:29 +0300

jsoncheck (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Added JSON syntax validation using cJSON.
  * Added line, column and byte offset error reporting.
  * Added pretty and compact JSON formatting.
  * Added command-line options --pretty and --compact.
  * Added support for /etc/jsoncheck/jsoncheck.conf.
  * Added --help and --version commands.
  * Added CMake build and Debian package support.

